<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH CAPACITY UTILISATION FLAT AT 83.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>DUTCH CAPACITY UTILISATION FLAT AT 83.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch</p>
<p>manufacturing capacity utilisation was flat at 83.8 percent in</p>
<p>March from 83.9 percent in December the Central Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
<p>DUTCH MANUFACTURING CAPACITY UTILISATION</p>
<p>					    March 97    Dec 96   March 96</p>
<p> Total industry			  83.8	 83.9	 83.5</p>
<p> - semi-manufactured goods	   83.1	 82.8	 82.5</p>
<p> - capital goods			 83.9	 84.2	 83.7</p>
<p> - consumer goods			84.5	 84.9	 84.5</p>
<p>Note - The CBS publishes capacity utilisation data once every</p>
<p>three months.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
